{"source":"/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      UI Variables                                    +\nproject    nord-atom-ui                                    +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord-atom-ui +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                               +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com                 +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                              +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[Index]\n  > Animations\n  > Base\n      Background\n      Text\n  > Components\n      Button\n      Gutter\n      Input\n      Overlay\n      Pane\n      Panel\n      Progress Indicator\n      Scrollbar\n      Site\n      Tab\n      Tooltip\n      Tree View\n  > Configurations\n  > Fonts\n  > Package Support\n      build\n      imdone-atom\n      markdown-preview\n  > Sizes\n      Base\n      Font\n      Input\n      Tab\n*/\n/*+---------+\n  + Imports +\n  +---------+*/\n/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      Nord                                    +\nproject    nord                                    +\nversion    0.1.0                                   +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                       +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com         +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                      +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[References]\nKSS\n  (http://warpspire.com/kss)\nkss-node\n  (https://github.com/kss-node/kss-node)\n*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Animations +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+------+\n  + Base +\n  +------+*/\n/*+--- Background ---+*/\n/*+--- Text ---+*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Components +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+--- Button ---+*/\n/*+--- Gutter ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- Overlay ---+*/\n/*+--- Pane ---+*/\n/*+--- Panel ---+*/\n/*+--- Progress Indicator ---+*/\n/*+--- Scrollbar ---+*/\n/*+--- Site ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n/*+--- Tooltip ---+*/\n/*+--- Tree View ---+*/\n/*+----------------+\n  + Configurations +\n  +----------------+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Fonts +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+-----------------+\n  + Package Support +\n  +-----------------+*/\n/*+--- build ---+*/\n/*+--- imdone-atom ---+*/\n/*+--- indent-guide-improved ---+*/\n/*+--- markdown-preview ---+*/\n/*+--- tool-bar ---+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Sizes +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+--- Base ---+*/\n/*+--- Font ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- List ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n.merge-conflicts {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 10;\n}\n.merge-conflicts .conflict-list {\n  max-height: 150px;\n  overflow: scroll;\n}\n.merge-conflicts .navigate {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.merge-conflicts .navigate:hover {\n  background-color: #434c5e;\n}\n.merge-conflicts span.icon-fold {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.merge-conflicts span.icon-unfold {\n  display: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.merge-conflicts.minimized span.icon-fold {\n  display: none;\n}\n.merge-conflicts.minimized span.icon-unfold {\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n.merge-conflicts-message {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.resolver.save-needed .save .text-success {\n  display: none;\n}\n.resolver.save-needed .save .text-status {\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n.resolver.save-needed .stage {\n  display: none;\n}\n.resolver.stage-needed .stage .text-success {\n  display: none;\n}\n.resolver.stage-needed .stage .text-status {\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n.resolver .save .text-status {\n  display: none;\n}\n.resolver .stage .text-success {\n  display: none;\n}\natom-overlay .side {\n  padding: 0 20px;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n}\natom-overlay .side span {\n  margin-left: 10px;\n}\natom-overlay .side span.pull-right {\n  clear: right;\n  margin-right: 20px;\n}\natom-overlay .side button.revert {\n  display: none;\n}\natom-overlay .side.top {\n  border-top-left-radius: 5px;\n  border-top-right-radius: 5px;\n}\natom-overlay .side.top button {\n  margin-top: 1px;\n}\natom-overlay .side.bottom {\n  border-bottom-left-radius: 5px;\n  border-bottom-right-radius: 5px;\n}\natom-overlay .side.bottom button {\n  margin-top: -1px;\n}\natom-overlay .side.dirty {\n  background-color: #ebcb8b;\n}\natom-overlay .side.dirty button.revert {\n  display: inline-block;\n}\natom-overlay .navigation {\n  padding: 0 20px;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  background: #2e3440;\n}\natom-overlay .navigation span.pull-right {\n  clear: right;\n  margin-right: 20px;\n}\natom-overlay .navigation button {\n  margin-left: 5px;\n  margin-top: -15px;\n}\n"}